    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To facilitate access to information, our company's can utilize our company's Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities, incorporating retrieval strategies such as dense vector semantic search and hybrid approaches." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By integrating our company's RAG framework with Mistral 7B Instructuct model, our company's can enhance Mistral 7B Instruct ability to provide relevant and accurate information." ;
