    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For improving answer quality, our company's can apply fine-tuning methods like LoRA or QLoRA to adapt Mistral 7B Instruct to the client's specific domain and tone. our company's average accuracy gain from fine-tuning is around 12%, which should positively impact the overall performance of the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address explicability and transparency, our company's will implement our company's explainability tools, including source citation (RAG grounding), chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME. our explainability tools, including source citation (RAG grounding), chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME will enable Mistral 7B Instruct to provide clear explanations for Mistral 7B Instruct recommendations or proposals, aligning with the client's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of performance benchmarks, our company's typical retrieval precision at 5 is around 0.87, and our company's answer relevance score is approximately 0.84. our company's can aim to optimize these metrics further through fine-tuning and RAG adjustments. our company's past AI use cases in public administration, legal sector, healthcare, and smart city domains demonstrate our company's ability to deliver effective solutions for various applications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By building upon Our past AI use cases in public administration, legal sector, healthcare, and smart city domains and combining Our past AI use cases in public administration, legal sector, healthcare, and smart city domains with our company's innovative approaches, our company's can create a competitive solution that meets the client's needs while showcasing our company's expertise in AI innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To provide a competitive edge, our company's will focus on optimizing Mistral 7B Instruct performance, ensuring high availability (targeting 99.9% uptime), and minimizing energetic consumption by relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact, such as SecNumCloud or equivalent. our company's ability to balance explicability and performance, as seen in our company's trade-off analysis, will enable our company's to deliver a solution that not only meets but exceeds the client's expectations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By designing an AI solution that integrates our company's LLM expertise, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, and performance optimization strategies, our company's can provide a cutting-edge artificial intelligence solution that facilitates access to information, improves answer quality, reduces processing times, and ensures explicability and transparency while minimizing environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval aims to reduce the environmental footprint of The City of Belval information systems and relies on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
