    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering our company's EcoVadis rating, carbon footprint, green hosting partners, digital sobriety practices, social commitments, AI ethics principles, and known sustainability trade-offs as of 2024, how can our company's propose a solution that not only meets but exceeds these environmental expectations, contributing to the reduction of energetic consumption and promoting sustainable development?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the CSR & Sustainability Officer of our company's S.r.l., the CSR & Sustainability Officer of Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can propose a solution that aligns with The City of Belval environmental goals. our company's has an EcoVadis rating of Silver, with a score of 62, indicating our company's commitment to sustainability. our company's have already conducted a bilan carbone in 2023 and have a net-zero target year of 2040." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To reduce energetic consumption, our company's can leverage our company's green hosting partners, OVHcloud and Scaleway, both located in France and powered by 100% renewable energy. our company's digital sobriety practices, such as INT8/INT4 model quantisation, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and green IT hardware procurement policy, can also contribute to minimizing energy consumption. our company's estimate that these practices can reduce energy consumption by around 35% compared to our company's baseline. our company's AI ethics principles, including transparency, explainability, and human oversight, will ensure that our company's solution is not only environmentally friendly but also responsible and trustworthy. our company's can propose a solution that integrates with the existing system of information, reducing the multiplicity of sources and promoting data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To exceed the City of Belval's environmental goals, our company's can offer to conduct regular carbon footprint assessments and provide detailed reports on our energetic consumption. our company's can also propose a progressive deployment plan, starting with a pilot phase, to ensure that our solution is scalable and adaptable to The City of Belval needs while minimizing waste and reducing electronic waste through our company's partnership with Ecologic, a certified WEEE recycling partner." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, our company's social commitments, including a gender equality index of 88, disabled workers representation of 4.2%, and local subcontracting preference, demonstrate our company's dedication to social responsibility. our company's can provide training for The City of Belval agents on our solution, ensuring that the city's agents are equipped to use our solution efficiently and effectively, which is in line with our company's average of 42 training hours per employee per year." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

