    <http://example.org/node/chunk48> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Interfaces of API type will be expected. 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk49> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Sovereignty constraints the local authority grants a particular importance to the sovereignty of the data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk5> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "General description of the need The expected solution will have to allow to provide to the agents an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from the agents work environment, capable of accompanying the agents in the agents administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from their work environment, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities could notably bear on: the search for information in the internal procedures and the applicable regulation, the help with the drafting of letters or of answers to the users, the accompaniment in the instruction of files (town planning, social aids, civil status, etc.), the suggestion of actions or of steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk50> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the hosting will have to be realized on an infrastructure of SecNumCloud type or equivalent, a particular attention will be brought to the dependence vis-à-vis non-European suppliers. 7." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk51> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Budgetary constraints The global budget allocated to the project is estimated at 3 million euros over a duration of 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk52> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The annual cost of exploitation will have to remain mastered and compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk53> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose an approach allowing to optimize the costs while guaranteeing the quality of service expected. 8." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk54> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Environmental constraints In the framework of City of Belval policy of sustainable development, City of Belval wishes to limit the environmental footprint of City of Belval systems of information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk55> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose a solution contributing to the reduction of the energetic consumption and relying, as much as possible, on infrastructures with low carbon impact. 9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk56> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Modalities of deployment the project will have to be conducted in a progressive manner, with: a pilot phase on a limited scope, a progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk57> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An accompaniment to the change and actions of training of the agents will be expected. 10." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk58> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Criteria of evaluation of the offers the offers will be evaluated with regard to the following criteria: quality and relevance of the proposed solution, compliance to the regulatory requirements, level of security, global cost of the proposed solution, taking into account of the environmental issues, capacity of innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk59> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that the City of Belval has a budget of 3 million euros over 4 years, with an annual cost of exploitation that must remain compatible with the City of Belval budgetary capacities, and considering our company's PM methodologies, past public sector references, consortium partners, available capacity, and governance practices as of 2024, how can our company's ensure the project is delivered within these financial constraints while meeting all the requirements and constraints outlined in the call for tenders?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk6> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution into the existing practices of the agents and not constitute a rupture in the agents modes of work. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk60> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To deliver the project within these financial constraints, our company's will leverage our company's experience in managing large public sector projects, with a largest project managed worth 4.5 million euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk61> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given a budget of 3 million euros over 4 years, our company's will ensure cost-effectiveness by applying our company's PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, or SAFe methodologies, depending on which best suits the project needs. our company's past references in the public sector, such as the Comune di Torino and Regione Lombardia projects, demonstrate our company's ability to manage significant budgets and deliver high-quality services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk62> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For the projectject, our company's will assemble a team with the right mix of skills, possibly including partners from our company's known consortium partners like EuroCloud Solutions S.A. for sovereign cloud hosting, LexIA GmbH for legal AI expertise, or GreenCompute S.r.l. for green IT solutions, to ensure all aspects of the project are adequately covered while keeping costs under control. our company's available PM capacity is 60% as of 2024, allowing our company's to dedicate sufficient project management resources to the project. our company's will implement our company's typical delivery structure, which includes phases like Inception & Design, Pilot / MVP, Full Rollout, and Operations & Support, ensuring a structured approach that aligns with the client's requirement for a progressive deployment manner." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Governance tools such as RAID logs, Decision logs, Change request processes, and Steering committees will be utilized to maintain transparency and control throughout the project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regular reporting through weekly status reports, monthly steering committee meetings, and quarterly executive reviews will keep all stakeholders informed of progress and any financial implications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk65> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the annual cost of exploitation, our company's will work closely with the City of Belval to ensure that our company's solution not only meets the City of Belval needs but also fits within the City of Belval budgetary constraints for ongoing operations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk66> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This might involve optimizing system maintenance costs, energy consumption, and ensuring that our solution design supports cost-effective scaling or adjustments as needed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk67> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining our company's project management capabilities, past experience in public sector projects, consortium partnerships, and adherence to rigorous governance practices, our company's is well-positioned to deliver a high-quality solution to the City of Belval within our company's budgetary constraints while satisfying all outlined requirements and constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval requires an artificial intelligence solution that provides a response time under 2 seconds, integrates with The City of Belval existing system of information (including business softwares, electronic management of documents, and user directories), achieves high availability of at least 99.9%, and relies on infrastructures with low carbon impact such as SecNumCloud or equivalent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our current technology stack and performance benchmarks, how can our design an architecture that meets these technical requirements while ensuring the solution is scalable, secure, and sovereign?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk7> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The City of Belval technical requirements, our can leverage our experience in cloud architecture, AI/ML systems, and data engineering." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our current technology stack, I propose designing an architecture based on the following components: Firstly, to achieve a response time under 2 seconds, our can utilize our expertise in API integration and deploy the solution on a cloud provider with low latency, such as OVHcloud or Scaleway, which our have experience with. our can also employ containerization using Docker and Kubernetes (K8s) to ensure efficient resource allocation and scalability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Secondly, to integrate with The City of Belval existing system of information, our can use our knowledge of API standards (REST, GraphQL, SOAP) and message brokers (Apache Kafka, RabbitMQ) to develop a seamless interface between the solution and The City of Belval business softwares, electronic management of documents, and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Thirdly, to achieve high availability of at least 99.9%, our can design the architecture with redundancy and failover capabilities using Terraform for infrastructure-as-code (IaC) management and Ansible for configuration management. our experience with monitoring tools like Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK stack will also help our ensure proactive maintenance and quick issue resolution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, to rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact, our can host the solution on SecNumCloud or an equivalent infrastructure, which aligns with our environmental optimization goals. our have experience with green hosting partners like OVHcloud and Scaleway, ensuring a reduced carbon footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure scalability, security, and sovereignty, our will implement the following measures: * Use our expertise in cybersecurity to design a secure architecture with network segmentation, mTLS between services, and encryption (AES-256 at rest, TLS 1.3 in transit). * Implement secrets management using HashiCorp Vault or CyberArk Conjur. * Ensure data protection and sovereignty by hosting data within the European Union and complying with GDPR regulations. * Provide regular training and support to The City of Belval agents to ensure a smooth transition and optimal use of the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging our technical expertise and experience, our can design an architecture that meets The City of Belval technical requirements while ensuring scalability, security, and sovereignty. the solution will provide a fast, reliable, and environmentally friendly artificial intelligence solution that integrates seamlessly with The City of Belval existing systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The call for tenders emphasizes strict compliance with the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR), encryption or anonymization of sensitive data if necessary, no transfer of data outside the EU, and explicability and transparency of recommendations or proposals." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk78> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering our company's security controls, audit capabilities, and experience with the EU regulatory frameworks (the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR), EU AI Act, RGS, SecNumCloud, NIS2) as of 2024, what measures can our company's implement to guarantee these requirements are met and ensure the solution is designed with security and compliance in mind?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk79> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To guarantee strict compliance with the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) and meet the specified requirements, our company's, can implement several measures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk8> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to be in measure to contextualize the answers in function of the demand of the agent. 3.2 Assistance with the drafting The expected solution will have to propose a help with the drafting of administrative contents, notably: answers to the users, administrative letters, syntheses of files." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's experience with the EU regulatory frameworks as of 2024, including the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR), EU AI Act, RGS, SecNumCloud, and NIS2 Directive, our company's are well-positioned to ensure our company's solution adheres to these standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, regarding data protection, our company's will ensure that all personal data is hosted within the EU, as per the requirement for data residency. our company's standard data residency policy already specifies that data must be stored in the EU, which aligns with the requirement for data residency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To protect sensitive data, our company's can utilize encryption and anonymization techniques if necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, our company's experience with the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) compliance includes the use of anonymization tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models for protecting personal data. the use of anonymization tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models for protecting personal data ensures that any sensitive information is appropriately secured and anonymized to prevent identification of individuals." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, our company's have a strict cross-border transfer policy that prohibits the transfer of data outside the EU unless there is an explicit legal basis for doing so. a strict cross-border transfer policy that prohibits the transfer of data outside the EU unless there is an explicit legal basis for doing so aligns with the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) requirements and ensures that all data transfers are legally compliant and secure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For explicability and transparency of recommendations or proposals issued by our company's AI-powered information systems, our company's can design the solution to provide clear explanations for the solution outputs. our company's experience with AI security controls includes output PII redaction, adversarial input detection, and confidence threshold escalation, which contributes to ensuring that the system's decisions are transparent and explainable. our company's certification under ISO 27001 for the design, development, and operation of AI-powered information systems demonstrates our company's commitment to information security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This certification, valid until November 30, 2026, ensures that our company's have implemented robust security controls to protect against various threats." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's experience with conducting Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIAs) will be beneficial in identifying and mitigating any data protection risks associated with the proposed solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "On average, our company's DPIAs are completed within three weeks, indicating our company's efficiency in assessing and addressing potential risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with regulatory requirements, including the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR), our company's will conduct regular audits and logging, utilizing tools like Wazuh and Elastic SIEM for real-time SIEM integration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "All queries are logged, and log immutability is ensured through append-only methods with SHA-256 hash chaining, providing a secure audit trail." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, our company's appointment of a Data Protection Officer (DPO) and the availability of a DPA template demonstrate our company's readiness to comply with the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) organizational requirements. a Data Protection Officer (DPO) can be contacted at dpo@nexus-engineering.it for any data protection concerns or inquiries." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In summary, by leveraging our company's experience with the EU regulatory frameworks, implementing robust security controls, utilizing anonymization and encryption techniques, ensuring transparency in AI decision-making, and maintaining strict compliance with data residency and transfer policies, our company's can guarantee that the proposed solution meets the requirements for the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) compliance, security, and explicability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval requires that no decision be automated without explicit validation by an agent, and the solution must comply with all regulatory requirements in force." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's legal standing, procurement experience across EU jurisdictions, IP model, insurance, standard contractual clauses, and AI regulatory posture (GDPR, EU AI Act) as of 2024, what are the key legal risks our company's should flag, and how can our company's ensure the solution complies with all relevant laws and regulations?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's context, our company's must flag the following key legal risks:  Firstly, ensuring that the solution complies with the EU AI Act requirements, particularly given the solution limited-risk classification. our company's has expertise in this area as indicated by \"eu_ai_act_expertise\": true." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Secondly, our company's need to ensure compliance with GDPR regulations since the solution will likely involve processing personal data. our company's is familiar with GDPR and has a standard legal basis for processing under Article 6(1)(e), as well as a data protection agreement template (DPA) version 3.2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Thirdly, as The City of Belval requires decisions not to be automated without explicit agent validation, our company's must ensure the solution incorporates human oversight mechanisms, which aligns with our company's policy of no automated decision-making without human validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Fourthly, given that our company's operates across multiple EU jurisdictions, including Italy, France, Germany, and Belgium, our company's should verify the specific regulatory requirements in each relevant jurisdiction to ensure full compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, considering our company's standard intellectual property model is work-for-hire, with all deliverables transferred to the client upon final payment, our company's must confirm this arrangement meets The City of Belval requirements for data ownership and usage rights." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

